	"item": [
		{
			"name": "Authentication",
			"item": [
				{
					"name": "Login",
					"event": [
						{
							"listen": "test",
							"script": {
								"exec": [
									"if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
									"    pm.collectionVariables.set(\"jwt_token\", pm.response.json().token);",
									"}"
								],
								"type": "text/javascript"
							}
						}
					],
					"request": {
						"method": "POST",
						"header": [],
						"body": {
							"mode": "raw",
							"raw": "{\n    \"username\": \"admin\",\n    \"password\": \"admin123\"\n}",
							"options": {
								"raw": {
									"language": "json"
								}
							}
						},
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{baseUrl}}/login",
							"host": [
								"{{baseUrl}}"
							],
							"path": [
								"login"
							]
						},
						"description": "Endpoint untuk otentikasi user. Mengembalikan token JWT yang akan digunakan untuk otorisasi pada endpoint lain. \n\n**Test Script**: Token yang diterima akan otomatis disimpan sebagai *collection variable* `jwt_token`."
					},
					"response": []
				},
				{
					"name": "Logout",
					"request": {
						"method": "POST",
						"header": [],
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{baseUrl}}/logout",
							"host": [
								"{{baseUrl}}"
							],
							"path": [
								"logout"
							]
						},
						"description": "Endpoint untuk logout (saat ini hanya mengembalikan pesan sukses, tidak ada invalidasi token di sisi server)."
					},
					"response": []
				}
			],
			"description": "Endpoint terkait otentikasi user."
		},
		{
			"name": "Sensor & Area Data",
			"item": [
				{
					"name": "Get All Sensor Statuses (Real-time)",
					"request": {
						"method": "GET",
						"header": [],
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{baseUrl}}/sensor/statuses",
							"host": [
								"{{baseUrl}}"
							],
							"path": [
								"sensor",
								"statuses"
							]
						},
						"description": "Mengambil status real-time (data terbaru dalam 10 menit terakhir) dari semua sensor suhu dan kelembaban. Endpoint ini sangat berguna untuk dashboard utama.\n\n- **Output**: Array dari status sensor, dikelompokkan berdasarkan area dan nomor sensor, beserta statusnya (`normal`, `warning`, `danger`)."
					},
					"response": []
				},
				{
					"name": "Get Detailed Alerts (Today)",
					"request": {
						"method": "GET",
						"header": [],
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{baseUrl}}/sensor/alerts",
							"host": [
								"{{baseUrl}}"
							],
							"path": [
								"sensor",
								"alerts"
							]
						},
						"description": "Mengambil daftar semua alert (peringatan atau kritis) yang terjadi pada hari ini untuk sensor suhu dan kelembaban.\n\n- **Output**: Array dari objek alert yang detail, berisi nama area, tipe sensor, nilai sebelum dan sesudah, deskripsi, status, dan waktu kejadian."
					},
					"response": []
				},
				{
					"name": "Get Area Summary by Sensor",
					"request": {
						"method": "GET",
						"header": [],
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{baseUrl}}/area/s0_13/sensor/1/summary?start=2024-01-01&end=today",
							"host": [
								"{{baseUrl}}"
							],
							"path": [
								"area",
								"s0_13",
								"sensor",
								"1",
								"summary"
							],
							"query": [
								{
									"key": "start",
									"value": "2024-01-01",
									"description": "Tanggal mulai (YYYY-MM-DD, RFC3339, atau 'today')"
								},
								{
									"key": "end",
									"value": "today",
									"description": "Tanggal akhir (YYYY-MM-DD, RFC3339, atau 'today')"
								}
							]
						},
						"description": "Menyediakan ringkasan statistik (min, max, avg, last) dan data tabel historis untuk satu sensor spesifik dalam rentang waktu tertentu.\n\n- **Path Params**: `area_id` (format `s0_{id}`), `no` (nomor sensor).\n- **Query Params**: `start` & `end` (opsional, default 'today').\n- **Output**: Objek JSON berisi statistik dan array data untuk tabel."
					},
					"response": []
				},
				{
					"name": "Get Chart Data for Sensor",
					"request": {
						"method": "GET",
						"header": [],
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{baseUrl}}/chart/sensor?area_id=s0_13&sensor_no=1&type=temperature&range=24h",
							"host": [
								"{{baseUrl}}"
							],
							"path": [
								"chart",
								"sensor"
							],
							"query": [
								{
									"key": "area_id",
									"value": "s0_13",
									"description": "ID Area dengan format 's0_{id}'"
								},
								{
									"key": "sensor_no",
									"value": "1",
									"description": "Nomor sensor"
								},
								{
									"key": "type",
									"value": "temperature",
									"description": "'temperature' atau 'humidity'"
								},
								{
									"key": "range",
									"value": "24h",
									"description": "Rentang waktu relatif, contoh: '1h', '24h', '7d', '30d'. Jika ini diisi, start/end date diabaikan."
								},
								{
									"key": "start_date",
									"value": "2024-08-15T00:00:00+07:00",
									"description": "Tanggal mulai absolut (format RFC3339). Digunakan jika 'range' tidak ada.",
									"disabled": true
								},
								{
									"key": "end_date",
									"value": "2024-08-15T23:59:59+07:00",
									"description": "Tanggal akhir absolut (format RFC3339). Digunakan jika 'range' tidak ada.",
									"disabled": true
								}
							]
						},
						"description": "Mengambil data time-series yang dioptimalkan untuk charting (grafik) untuk satu sensor spesifik.\n\n- **Query Params**:\n  - `area_id`: Wajib. Contoh: `s0_1`.\n  - `sensor_no`: Wajib. Contoh: `1`.\n  - `type`: Wajib. `'temperature'` atau `'humidity'`.\n  - `range`: Opsional. Rentang waktu relatif, contoh: `1h`, `24h`, `7d`.\n  - `start_date` & `end_date`: Opsional. Rentang waktu absolut (format RFC3339). Digunakan jika `range` tidak diisi."
					},
					"response": []
				}
			]
		},
